  "fuse": "SENSITIVITY: at release only the arriving flux passes; the pocket keeps its catch",
  "refloat_mult": "SENSITIVITY: one-way pocket scales tidal re-float; x1 with the fuse equals variant b"
 },
 "caveats": [
  "SIMULATED: escaped_kg is computed by the same assumed process model that the policies act on, so results show relative value under stated assumptions, not field evidence; field calibration comes in Round 2.",
